{"29797":[{"footnoteId":7874,"paragraphs":[{"pid":38,"text":"Or “lacking loyal love.”"}]}],"29798":[{"footnoteId":7875,"paragraphs":[{"pid":39,"text":"Or “those who swear falsely.”"}]},{"footnoteId":7876,"paragraphs":[{"pid":40,"text":"Or “healthful; beneficial.”"}]}],"29820":[{"footnoteId":7877,"paragraphs":[{"pid":41,"text":"Or “remain calm; remain quiet.”"}]}],"29823":[{"footnoteId":7878,"paragraphs":[{"pid":42,"text":"Lit., “they.”"}]}],"29828":[{"footnoteId":7879,"paragraphs":[{"pid":43,"text":"Or “manage.”"}]}],"29830":[{"footnoteId":7880,"paragraphs":[{"pid":44,"text":"Or “a good reputation.”"}]},{"footnoteId":7881,"paragraphs":[{"pid":45,"text":"Or “disgrace.”"}]}],"29833":[{"footnoteId":7882,"paragraphs":[{"pid":46,"text":"Or “tested as to whether they qualify.”"}]}],"29878":[{"footnoteId":7883,"paragraphs":[{"pid":47,"text":"Or “Stop drinking just water.”"}]}],"29888":[{"footnoteId":7884,"paragraphs":[{"pid":48,"text":"Or “sustenance.”"}]}],"29893":[{"footnoteId":7885,"paragraphs":[{"pid":49,"text":"Or possibly, “who brings all things to life.”"}]}],"29895":[{"footnoteId":7886,"paragraphs":[{"pid":50,"text":"Or possibly, “his.”"}]}]}